# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local development.
# Set BETTER_AUTH_SECRET (at least 32 characters), and also set SETUP_SECRET
# (any non-empty value) in .dev.vars — the one-click Deploy button configures
# SETUP_SECRET as a visible Worker var from wrangler.jsonc instead of an
# encrypted secret, so you can paste the same value into /admin/setup. Never
# commit .dev.vars or reuse production values locally. RECOVERY_SECRET is
# deliberately absent by default; add any independent non-empty value only for
# a temporary recovery window, then remove it.

BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-an-independent-random-secret
# SETUP_SECRET=replace-with-any-non-empty-setup-secret
# RECOVERY_SECRET=replace-with-a-temporary-independent-recovery-secret
